# Morroblivion from New Game: the game selector hands off to fbmwChargen stage 1 (the prison ship: Jiub speaks three
# times with the player's controls off, then looks at the guard) and pops the RaceSex Menu.
# Stages are fbmwChargen's (TES4 numbers): 1 ship, 5 off the ship, 10 class menu, 20 birthsign menu, 30 after Sellus
# Gravius, 100 arrived. The quest script's own counters (JiubSpeak, Guard01Stage, GuardDockStage, CensusStage,
# ClassQuizStage) step through each conversation.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance questtest --cases <this folder> --new-game 3 --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case mb_chargen_ship
until 900 GetStage fbmwChargen >= 1
end

# Menu expected: "RaceSex Menu" (TESGameSelect BeginChosenGame calls Game.ShowRaceMenu 0.5 s after the hand-off).
case mb_chargen_race_menu
wait 60
close RaceSex Menu
end

# Jiub's three lines, then he looks at the guard (JiubSpeak -1).
case mb_chargen_jiub
until 1800 fbmwChargen.JiubSpeak == -1
end

# Jiub's second line sets Guard01Stage 1 and starts the guard's move; at its end the guard speaks (2, 3), the player's
# controls come back and the guard turns to his escort (4).
case mb_chargen_guard
until 3600 fbmwChargen.Guard01Stage >= 4
end

# The player goes up through the hatch (mwCGshipdoorRef) and walks down to the dock, where the dock guard's trigger
# zone (01F8E963, no EditorID) stops the player for his two lines. The deck's navmesh is its own island, so setpos
# stands in for the gangplank, to a dock spot 300 units short of the zone, and the player walks into it from there.
case mb_chargen_dock
activate mwCGshipdoorRef
wait 300
run
player.setpos x -8950
player.setpos y -73150
player.setpos z 140
wait 60
walk 01F8E963
until 1800 fbmwChargen.GuardDockStage >= 4
end

# The player walks to the Census and Excise Office's dock-side door (0181BCE5) and goes in; the trigger zone inside it
# (01F8E962) hands the player to Socucius Ergalla, who offers the class quiz; the player skips it (button 1 of
# "Take Quiz|Skip Quiz"), and stage 10 opens the class menu.
case mb_chargen_census
walk 0181BCE5
activate 0181BCE5
wait 300
walk 01F8E962
until 1800 fbmwChargen.ClassQuizStage >= 1
wait 120
button 1
end

# Stage 10's ShowClassMenu opens MorrowindRuntime's class menu; Socucius speaks (CensusStage 3), and CensusStage 4
# sets stage 20, whose ShowBirthsignMenu opens the birthsign menu. A pick waits for its menu; an until would wait for
# the menu to close.
case mb_chargen_class
pick Warrior
pick The Warrior
until 1800 fbmwChargen.CensusStage >= 6
expect GetStage fbmwChargen >= 20
end

# The release papers on Socucius's desk (mwCGPapersREF): taking them sets GotPapers and unlocks the hall door
# (AAMWChargenDoor1REF) to Sellus Gravius.
case mb_chargen_papers
walk mwCGPapersREF
take mwCGPapersREF
until 600 fbmwChargen.GotPapers == 1
end

# Sellus Gravius's "duties" (while fbmwMQ01 is below 1) hands over Caius's package and sets stage 30, which unlocks the
# exit door.
# His office is its own building across the courtyard: out through the hall's far door (0181D371), across to his
# office door (0181BCE1), in, and on to him. His greeting takes the papers and adds "duties" when it ends.
case mb_chargen_sellus
walk 0181D371
activate 0181D371
wait 300
walk 0181BCE1
activate 0181BCE1
wait 300
walk SellusGraviusRef
talk SellusGraviusRef
hear 600 SellusGraviusRef some duties for you
wait 120
ask duties
until 300 GetStage fbmwChargen >= 30
bye
end

# The exit door asks to revise the character; "Finished - Exit" (button 3) sets gotoStage 100 and lets the player out.
case mb_chargen_exit
walk AAMWChargenDoor2REF
activate AAMWChargenDoor2REF
wait 60
button 3
until 1800 GetStage fbmwChargen >= 100
end
